WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:04.317
Your company already knows a lot.
It's just spread out:

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.890
in email, chat, files, meetings
and systems that don't talk to each other.

3
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.077
HAI Seed starts with you, the owner.

4
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.580
We plant it in your company,
on your machine, under your rules.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.683
HAI Root grows into the sources you choose,

6
00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:25.177
and connects them into one living memory:

7
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:29.370
who said what, what was agreed,
and what has changed since.

8
00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.457
HAI Kernel applies your rules.

9
00:00:33.540 --> 00:00:37.340
It runs the checks you agree on,
every day and every week.

10
00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.387
HAI Crown keeps watch for what needs you:

11
00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:45.817
a customer changing course,
a promise slipping, a risk building up.

12
00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:49.150
It brings each one to you,
with a recommendation.

13
00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.057
It prepares the work, too:
the brief, the comparison, the follow-up.

14
00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.670
You decide. Your team acts.

15
00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.577
Then it grows across your company.

16
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:05.573
Sales, finance and operations
each ask their own questions,

17
00:01:05.657 --> 00:01:08.030
from the same company memory.
